msgid "Chassis_F18_Bat_Chatillon25t_hound_TLXXL"
msgstr "Foudre"

msgid "F18_Bat_Chatillon25t_hound_TLXXL"
msgstr "Foudre"

msgid "F18_Bat_Chatillon25t_hound_TLXXL_descr"
msgstr ""
"Von Krieger taught his machines to think, because that's the only trick he "
"knows. He really believes intelligence is what makes a human a human, "
"despite evolution suggesting otherwise. We didn't get here by thinking "
"first; we got here scared, hungry, and reckless. He, on the other hand, "
"thought he could build the top floor without laying a foundation first. Fine"
" by me, I'll knock it all down regardless. This Foudre's been to hell and "
"back, and it's got everything I need to leave smoke where his toys used to "
"be. Time to give the mad scientist a glimpse of what real life looks like."

